type: software
title: "OpenSpanGuard"
abstract: >-
  OTLP/HTTP JSON enrichment gateway that evaluates completed generation spans,
  preserves original trace and span IDs and timestamps, and exposes evaluation
  coverage alongside quality scores in Prometheus and Grafana.
